    "id": "BR006",
    "description": "Validate new balance",
    "logic": "IF WS-NEW-BALANCE < 0 THEN MOVE 'INSUFFICIENT FUNDS' TO WS-MESSAGE ELSE MOVE 'TRANSACTION SUCCESSFUL' TO WS-MESSAGE END-IF",
